# FontFix: talk balloon text at airport/1 (message 84 of common/2d/balloon.bmg, five lines). Shots while the balloon
# is open; the text is read from the PNGs (b_tp120.png shows the whole message).
# Start as tools/routes/98_shine_save_shots.dev: SUNSHINE_DEV_START=airport/1 SUNSHINE_DEV_SKIP_MOVIES=1 SUNSHINE_DEV_SEED=1
# SUNSHINE_RENDER_SCALE=1; settings.ini [video] fsr1=0 widescreen=1 aspect=4:3 (or aspect=16:9 for the 16:9 counterpart).
# Before the talk: cheats, tpshine. The balloon is on screen from about tick 600 (b_tp120 in run hc_b169).
# Evidence: b_tp*.png (the balloon text), run.log (thp=0: no movie frame counts as a shot), rc of the run.
waitfor stage=0 scen=1 director mario dirstate=4 timeout=3000
cheat infinite_health
cheat infinite_water
wait frames=90
killboss
wait frames=300
tpshine
wait frames=30
shot b_tp030.png
wait frames=30
shot b_tp060.png
wait frames=30
shot b_tp090.png
wait frames=30
shot b_tp120.png
wait frames=30
shot b_tp150.png
wait frames=30
shot b_tp180.png
wait frames=60
shot b_tp240.png
wait frames=60
shot b_tp300.png
log
mash A period=30 until stage=1 timeout=3000
log
wait frames=300
log
end
